      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“要成为能赢得GⅠ的知名赛马娘”，\n考量到她的这个目标，\n选择新马级的GⅠ竞赛应该是比较适合的──",
      "source_fingerprint": "b91a48e57c367dde97491cf11eaf0d9908e3cd1c14886a4b833e8a39a21e79f2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
