      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b9a6f0077b9fce8bc2622a42",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "如果要调整到万全的状态，\n的确就不该以新马级的竞赛为优先考量，\n把目标定为“皋月赏”更为合适。",
      "source_fingerprint": "86261ebb2bf4f301976047e26819c723d8e54534aa8866abe3b3dcddd79e8270",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
