    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f5f40144714eb944f62d20a6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "是的。\n你觉得怎么样呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "84c2ddc48c41f5363ef2445bd2fc200985203238e4afe48e3dd2b909440fa39a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1067/storytimeline_501067113.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        11,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/11/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2386a1d165ef0243d59946c4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我没有反对的理由。\n若能在经典三冠取得胜利，\n那在GⅠ取胜也是必然的。是说──",
      "source_fingerprint": "1fdb967bfa8e3867a39c72ee23de83f265a22675041d4749925234f6711650a6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1067/storytimeline_501067113.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        12,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/12/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:65df4535296746356219859f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我只是觉得，你总是这么坚定",
      "source_fingerprint": "56631c76397bac5281d38d36dc567087793e4c3b27b8a87d4e28e9b3bdac61c7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1067/storytimeline_501067113.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
