    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2efb06ac90b5e4ac40e1d93a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就像我刚才所说的，\n里见家虽然一直都对赛马娘界的发展抱有热情，\n至今却从未有培育出知名赛马娘的经验。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc77d983ec9f73a0691d6a3b08cdafa901f26167f58c15243cba1a1c7c8a842f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1067/storytimeline_501067113.json",
      "json_path": [
