      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "里见家过去的赛马娘当中，\n没有一位是曾经在GⅠ竞赛中\n赢得胜利过的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "239ea84de9fdd99430497c989abd397e2ef0396e0fe6ab7ebeba002ffa0694f6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
