      "uid": "zhcn:a2f11123f952ba36249cac9b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "久而久之，\n就被称作是“里见家的魔咒”了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a5cbda3fe1825b09f156fd2db71de95c994d38be8dba435837385c46e3f053c8",
