      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "再加上，曾经很长一段时间都只生男生，\n家族一直没有新的赛马娘诞生……",
      "source_fingerprint": "cb53d12e5f5e68e650e4ffb4eace60decc6fde7ae8ddce1b2400309431375567",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1067/storytimeline_501067113.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        19,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/19/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6266cdc5ee81b5cdb08512aa",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不选择新马级的GⅠ竞赛吗？",
